Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天使们正在相互残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are slaughtering one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,已经正式开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an open warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一个奇怪的天使现身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A strange angel arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他受命于新的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he worked for the new God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到Metatron 然后让他血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find Metatron and I will make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去领导那些反叛我的天使 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the angels against me,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我有什么企图 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that you want of me,Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,重建天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuilt heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想做我的二把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be my second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先证明你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到他的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,说Poughkeepsie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Poughkeepsie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的暗语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our code word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是什么都别管 赶紧跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means drop everything and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,控制住 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把他驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron指使Gadreel杀了Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron made Gadreel kill Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这下事情就说通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,动手啊 杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这正合你意 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd like that,wouldn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你就坐在这里烂掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sit here and rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是故意让Winchester两兄弟抓住我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the Winchesters' grabbing me part of your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那是预料之外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我知道一件他们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know something they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon 她是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon,she's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,也是个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我从衣柜里穿越过来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I find most shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,最让我惊讶的事情是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my time traveling through closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然有人觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody thought it was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,应该让你当地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make you the King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我得谈谈改朝换代的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I have to talk about regime change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹上刻有恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A devil's trap carved in a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,防止你化成黑烟逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can keep you from smoking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱骑士不是那么容易死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knight of hell isn't exactly the dying kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有个东西能杀死地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something that can kill a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是该死的该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这个印 初刃毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the mark,the blade is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐之印可以传给值得的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark can be transferred to someone who's worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得知道 这个印记随之而来的沉重负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know with the mark comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以差遣地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends in hell hounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔的斗牛犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demonic pitbulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以控制它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去咬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但你现在一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are here a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.35,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我的海洛因 太过上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my addition makes you needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我的一言一行都汇报给了Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reported everything I did back to Abaddon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.73,Note,,0,0,0,,(利斯 苏格兰)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请进吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意我进来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你亲戚的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在最好还是出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be taking your leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 你在收拾行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,you are packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,漂洋过海到殖民地去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sailing for the colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.39,0:02:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,计划有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在开派对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we having a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对 告别派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,a farewell party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一只海鸥落到了他头上然后开始扑腾翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}A seagull landed on his head and started flapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.25,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能出来放松一个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how great it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真是兴奋到无以言表\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have a funny night out,right,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后另外一只海鸥过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this other seagull comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,释放所有的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out all the pressure,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 从那以后 再也没人想吃披萨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway,so no one had any pizza after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 能被他老人家亲自选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,I can't really complain being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我没什么可抱怨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand-picked by the big man himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实不应该提这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I'm not really supposed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那可是Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause it's Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他很依赖我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's come to depend on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道的 我们很铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you know,we're tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始赞赏这个疯子的远见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to appreciate the mad man's vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我们全部赶出了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled us all out of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 目光放远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他在重整天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's giving the place a makeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,带回被选中的少数天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing back the chosen fews.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,从少数被选中的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with the chosen,chosen fews.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们懂我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可是敏感时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are dangerous times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好管好自己的嘴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be careful what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好隔墙有耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know who might be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呵 你说的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho...you said plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很显然你觉得有必要讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently you felt the need to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,自己和Metatron的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your relationship with Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的战略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,机密信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Privileged information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这样口无遮拦 会有报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak that freely and there are consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你待会儿就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you are about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that..him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 司令要见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you follow me,commander will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还司令呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm,dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他有时候是挺古板的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can be a little stuffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,成司令了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,群龙无首 他们坚持要我带头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had no leader and they insist on following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,no,we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个摇滚明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Malachi也被Gadreel杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malachi was murdered by Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron现在如日中天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with Metatron as powerful as he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,天使之战在所难免 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this war between angels is really gonna happen,ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能通过外交手段摆脱Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if I can find a diplomatic option for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,何乐而不为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting rid of Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 天使们互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,this angel on angel violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿该有了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,必须有人站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to say enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人就是你喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that someone is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我请你们来 就是为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It brings me to...why you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收押了一个俘虏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是Metatron内线里的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an angel from Metatron's inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要套出他们的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know what they are planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止他只字未吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far he's revealed nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是你唱完白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are done with the rough stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们唱红脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want us to be your goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们干这种事情比较在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you've had success at these situations before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不愿意 我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want to do it,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I don't want to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:24.15,Note,,0,0,0,,(克利夫兰市 俄亥俄州)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,事情是这样的 同学们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here is the thing,boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有个大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,坦诚地讲 是我惹来的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admittedly,the crisis of my own making.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在我不在的日子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my extended absense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,忙着处理国家的敏感事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I handle sensitive matters of the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon混进了我们的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon made enrolled to my following.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,制造混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creating chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我指望你们 我的亲信\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I look to you,my trusted advisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们重拾信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}To restore confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抚慰民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}To soothe those jangled nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,放话下去 你们的王回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread the word,the king is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,帝国即将再度崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the kingdom is once again on sound footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意和我一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,all those with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,说 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我指现在我是和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I'm literally with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是要追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with-you with-you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们将见识到刑讯史上最残忍的酷刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in history of torture's been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,比你们所经历过最残忍的酷刑还要残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}With torture like the torture you will be tortured with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,同学们放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的效忠我笑纳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the new queen and I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,将来你们会前途无量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sitting at the popular kids' table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 坦率的讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,let's talk turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是你帮Winchesters兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you helped the Winchesters get their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了初刃 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the first blade,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我还听说他们中有一个背负着该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm hearing one of them also has the mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太糟糕了 因为初刃是唯一一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}All bad news since the Blade is the one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,能把我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can bring about my.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,带进坟墓的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utter destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be indelicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你可听好了 小乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing,pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你也别想逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为那两帅帅的兄弟会追杀谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think is next on those cute boys' list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现实点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我合作 解决了Winchester兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me and taking out the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那把破刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the ridiculous blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们两个再慢慢玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then,we'll deal with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我把话说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你合作的 决不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not be joining you,ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,除了 你死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except,at your death scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,场面一定很壮观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where shall burst into sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 你没有可以威胁到我的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye,you have no hold out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哦是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gavin 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin,honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟爹爹问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道一两个咒语 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a spell or two,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your big card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个孩子和我互相看不对眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy and I loathe each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说得很明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it clear in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不关心这臭小子会出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what happens to the little bugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.95,0:11:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是很久之前了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was before,wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我很了解你那点小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}See I know all about your little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗜血成瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binging on blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,接近变为人类的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going right at the edge of being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多人类的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of those human feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.53,0:11:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是愿意赌上一赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm willing to bet that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在某个角落还是留下了一丝人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a smidgin of humanity in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这些小伎俩吓唬不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know these coolish party tricks don't impress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过更可怕的 做过更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen worse,done worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你这招儿对我不管用 红发妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're playing a weak hand,Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我没什么可说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}We disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,折磨我没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no use to torture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是受过训练的士兵 没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a trained commando,it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 你这是在邀请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow,well you just ask me to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他要是死了我们就什么都不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be telling us anything,dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides,you know I'm really starting to realise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能真的什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只是假装自己是重要的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably just pretending at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他很可能什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely he's a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个Ezra 会是Metatron的精英手下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezra here,is one of the Metatron's elite posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别逗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron最信任的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Metatron's most trusted is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就在酒吧胡混 随随便便谈论自己的上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging out the bars,blabbing about the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,根本说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,除非Metatron就喜欢给自己招蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if Metatron's purposely surrounding himself with losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙究竟为啥在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this guy even doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,估计只是在幻想而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess a wanna-be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他真是核心人物的话 他怎么不在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean if he was a key player,he would be up in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,和Metatron一起演大戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Metatron where all the actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有可能是个诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I'm a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,或是卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in deep cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好心酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,估计他掉线之后 就没跟天堂联络过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably hasn't even been to heaven since his fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 大门都被封印了 谁都进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy,the gates are sealed,no one can get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谁跟你说大门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,有秘密入口还要门干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need gates when you have a private portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就算地球上有个传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was a doorway onto earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天使也会知道的 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The angels would've sensed it - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天使们不可能不知道的 - 说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't have something like that - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那个传送门到处移动 就真的没人知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can if it moves around from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,上司想放哪儿就放哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's wherever the boss wants it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸是Fergus McLeod\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was Fergus McLeod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一个小裁缝 酒鬼 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple tailor,a drunk,a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他没跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他一点都不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲手埋葬了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I buried him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,291年里会发生很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot can change 291 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿能烤熟鸽子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you cook a pigeon on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是没反应过来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not terribly quick,is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly mother of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在星星里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're amongst stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you heard a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron手里有个秘密传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Metatron's secret portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,于是你就决定誓死追随他了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you decided to run with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个脑残粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一个脑残粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个脑残粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你对Metatron一见钟情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you're hot for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是贾斯汀比伯还是贝克汉姆之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Bieber,or Beckham.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你对他们无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cause you know everything about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也不代表你就了解他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean you actually know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能完全不知道有你这么个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that they may not know you exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这么说太打击人了 - 我是说可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh,that's cold,Sam. - I'm just saying,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是被Metatron亲自接见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was interviewed personally by Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,竞争一个重要职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a key post.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那你跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么让你失去了这个重要职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you were out of your key post.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后沦落到这个地方来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're hanging down here instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你戳他软肋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...now,that blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他落选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got passed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我是最后几个候选者之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天 你差一点就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,man.He's so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,结果还是被刷下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then get kicked down stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你深表同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,能被选入的人都是凤毛麟角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly anybody was chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,此外陆军部队也是一个重要的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ground-force is still a very important assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,能成为行动小组的候选人都是一种荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to have even been considered for the squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么行动小组 根本没什么行动小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}What squad?There was no squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然不知道 这是最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,says you.It's a highly guarded secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你究竟要做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would you be doing exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我来理清一下思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarify this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你非常想要这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You desperately wanted this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你根本连要干什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你被选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,until you are chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会被告知任何有关工作的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exact nature of the mission was kept a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,并且几乎没有人被选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hardly anyone was chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一脸蠢相 怪不得被抓起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dimbod,no wonder he got bumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,陆军部队 秘密行动小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand forces,elite secret squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron到底要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Metatron gearing up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们不直接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we shove somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去那个天堂后门看看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the back door of heaven and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦对 那个破玩意儿是便携的 找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,wait.No.It's portable and can't be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你卖了你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就为了下半身的幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}For an extra three inches of willy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前可没有现在这么人见人爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't the bon vivant that I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,简单来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will simplify.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我的灵魂在地狱里恶魔化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul did a stint in hell where it became demonized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我必须附到别人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I had to possess on another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才能跟人类正常来往\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can traffic with the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of this sticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能跟一个恶魔厮混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be consorting with a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是什么普通的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Not just any demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是王 地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the King.The King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你又开始担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你老爹也许不会有多大作为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worrying the old man wouldn't amount to much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开时 他还是好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he was fine when we left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我几乎没怎么碰过那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've barely touched the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他还被锁着 没有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still shackled,no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不会是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.81,0:18:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 有天使杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.This was an angel kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay well I'm gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你的行动泄露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you operation has been hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你身边有Metatron的内鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron's got somebody in the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定这里所有人都是忠诚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sure everyone here was loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都是因为同一个目标聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally united by a common cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信有人会欺骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think anybody's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得所有人都在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think everybody is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去周围转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do some nosing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,do you have a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我想问你Gadreel的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to ask you about Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.31,0:19:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他附在你身上的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time he possessed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是特想谈论这件事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not really something I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他并没有完全附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't possess me,completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,更像是我们在共同使用一个身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like we share the housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你有感觉到他的存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever sense a presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我感觉到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know what I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我也发现自己不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that I wasn't completely alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经觉得自己受到威胁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever feel threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得他总是惶惶不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.More that he wasn't at rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,更像是他有没完成的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he has unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们对他有了进一步的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we know more about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他认为自己被误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say he felt misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但他并不危险对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,but not a danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,并不怀有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,并不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但很明显 我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong,obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,饿你饿到半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,经常喝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came home drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,继续打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat you some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来就是宿醉的感觉 然后接着打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke up hungover,and yeah,well,beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,其实这很正常啊 我也没有模板来对比\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all fairness,I didn't really have any role models.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小到大 一直都觉得我自己一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up thinking,knowing I was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,卑贱到可以忽略不计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你恨不得把我当马来使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked me harder the a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,从来不让我去学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let me go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,到今天 我连字都不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till this day,I can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.73,0:20:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有那么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分欧洲人都不识字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of Europe couldn't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,想认字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,海盗打败了圣徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some buccaneers beat the saints.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.15,0:21:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can this be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.73,0:21:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我能识字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱之王 大权在握\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of Hell,plenty of perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 如果你是王\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,if you're a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那我不就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说我什么都没给过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say I've...never given you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是个头衔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A title.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我承认你是我老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I was to accept you as my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你能让我脱离地狱的苦海吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could keep me from eternally burning in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我犯了什么原罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter my sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在跟我谈判吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're negotiating with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定真能成\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,活这么大以来 我第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到生活有了目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看到未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等你把我送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as soon as you take me back to my own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能登上去新世界的游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can aboard that ship to the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说到那个游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉Abaddon我准备好跟她谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can tell Abaddon I'm ready for that chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你一个人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我在Sam Winchester身体里的时候见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you through Sam Winchester's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你有维持荣誉的名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a reputation for honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是有人这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,说到名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for reputations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你同样名声在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours proceeds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在伊甸园里发生的事不是传说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in the Garden was not my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得自己被误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you feel misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.03,0:22:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你急于救赎你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're eager to redeem yourself and.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可能还有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.90,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在暗示我支持Matatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}You refer to my support of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.34,0:22:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,重新建立天堂这件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron's campaign to rebuild the heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:23:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你说是支持吗 你为他招募天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your support?You've recruited for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你为他大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've killed for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 你相信大局为重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you truly believe it's for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你跟错了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've placed your faith in the wrong master.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不了解他 - Gadreel 我太了解他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know him - I know him too well,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我犯过同样的错误 导致了天使的坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the same mistake which let to the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也给我带来了第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which led to my second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这一切不只是为了你自己 - Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is about more than just you - Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是让我背弃忠诚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting I change loyalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是让你重新站回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm suggesting you reclaim your original loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂这边 重拾我们最初的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the heaven and the mission we were meant to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是我正在做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was exactly what I was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你被蒙蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你承受了多少痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as bad as you've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你被关了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although centuries locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.15,0:23:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让Metatron来统治 只会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be much worse under Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.25,0:24:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.52,0:24:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,放下刀 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the Blade,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.87,0:24:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.39,0:24:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,发什么呆呢 接电话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you,you hear your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.45,0:24:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.25,0:24:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑什么鬼地方去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.23,0:24:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 一有Abaddon的消息就告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'd be in touch when I found Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不是在打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.75,0:24:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿 - 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you - First thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你初刃所在地的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you the location of the First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去拿初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two fetch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我看住Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep her in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.37,0:24:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们一起除掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll remove her from the payroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.53,0:24:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.02,0:25:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的非要把初刃藏在尸体里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really have to hide the blade in the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.54,0:25:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是放在尸体旁边 是在尸体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with a corpse...but in a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.89,0:25:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.72,0:25:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,打死我也不会想到在尸体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the first place I'd look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 开工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?Did you hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.78,0:25:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am guessing hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.75,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的Crowley坟墓有看守者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn is Crowley,grave is guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.87,0:26:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.92,0:26:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.79,0:26:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 那是她的本职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no no she was collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.06,0:26:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没人敢违背地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time was no one would dare disobey the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.83,0:26:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开免提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.62,0:26:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Juliet 我是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juliet,it's papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.62,0:26:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.32,0:27:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.17,0:27:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.23,0:27:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或许应该我来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.24,0:27:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy 没事的 我能很安全的取出来而不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,it's fine,I...I can safely grab it without.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.53,0:27:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们去杀了那个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,let's go kill a Knight of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我回去之后当然会登上那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'll board in a ship when I go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想过我自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go back to my lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不是什么好想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去殖民地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to the Colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.43,0:27:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在一点点接近目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am working my way across.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.90,0:27:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am giving you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gavin 听爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin,listen to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.38,0:27:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:27:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.34,0:28:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.63,0:28:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望你对你老爹态度好点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you're nice to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.99,0:28:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 闭嘴 我们已经拿到初刃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,shut up,we've got the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.57,0:28:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.97,0:28:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,马上带着初刃过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get it here at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,克利夫兰市 洪堡酒店 顶层公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleveland,Humboldt hotel,penthouse,of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.57,0:28:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你到了以后 我会带你去找Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get here,I'll take it to Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.53,0:28:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把她引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你们给她致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can skewer the ignorant hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,正送过来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sending in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.45,0:28:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要一直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天可是离开Poughkeepsie的好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good day to drive from the Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 我们离那儿十万八千里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about,we're not even near there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像我说的 你需要马上离开Poughkeepsie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said,you need to leave the Poughkeepsie right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.77,0:28:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一切正常吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.58,0:28:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:28:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.92,0:29:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在的情况是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.58,0:29:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟男孩们磨蹭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been plodding with those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.19,0:29:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.85,0:29:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到这里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.71,0:29:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.34,0:29:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first blade and a little old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.53,0:29:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一个都不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不介意跟老对头合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I don't mind stiff odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.80,0:29:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 你我都是明白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.74,0:29:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从Henry Winchester那\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,学来的小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Herry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.71,0:29:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我也这么干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled the same stunt on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.03,0:29:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹上刻了恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have devil's trap carved on the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会伤的很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not seriously damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.97,0:29:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只是瘫痪了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just paralysed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never would have agreed to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会去暗杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I thought concealed assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.54,0:29:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会同意和你见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would going to try to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.40,0:29:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是站在对立的阵线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are on the opposite side of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也相信我们都是为了荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe there must be honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.90,0:30:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,纵使这意味着战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even it matters a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.23,0:30:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是恰恰证明了我对Metatron的看法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it prove my point about Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.44,0:30:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你来见我本是好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met with me in good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他欺骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.02,0:30:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,利用你来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he used you to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.94,0:30:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,正如当年你孱弱的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as poor judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.67,0:30:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让你被囚禁多年一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undid you all those centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.91,0:30:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你错信了Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistaken trust Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.45,0:30:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这会让你付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will bring you down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.67,0:30:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他做了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道想让我现在对他宣战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you expect me to come make war on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不 完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.92,0:30:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就保持你现在的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我Metatron在密谋什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me reports on what Metatron is planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.85,0:30:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以及他何时出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he will strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.61,0:30:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚还说到荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the honor we were speaking of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.43,0:30:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.62,0:30:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我的队伍里有Metatron的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron has someone inside my camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他才知道我们要见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he knew we were meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.01,0:30:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是以其人之道还治其人之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fighting fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.95,0:30:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.49,0:31:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.32,0:31:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,wait,wait,hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上去之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should give this place once over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.32,0:31:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.85,0:31:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,why.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.25,0:31:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley说这栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley said he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.10,0:31:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,地下室里有不少恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some demons hiding down the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.45,0:31:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他自己会去料理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will check them out himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.42,0:31:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 如果我们从下面走 他就暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're going back at Abaddon that he'd be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么时候说这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did he say all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,电话上说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他也有可能是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,it might mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.40,0:31:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon知道他在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows that he's here,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.93,0:31:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你去地下室检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you check out the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.06,0:31:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看主楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take a look at the main floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.16,0:31:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.59,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真喜欢你眼睛里疯狂的嗜血冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love the crazy blood lust in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.09,0:32:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.41,0:32:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去找Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take you to Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.44,0:32:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,离得不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.62,0:32:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,手拿初刃的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy and his blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.91,0:32:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,依旧无法与女王抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still,no match for the new queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你会痛苦地死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die,painfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.56,0:32:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后Crowley会亲眼看着他儿子死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Crowley will watch the son die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.88,0:32:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,死法同上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就轮到他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the king himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃也会被毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And blade destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.48,0:33:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这任务清单可不短\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite a to-do-list.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.09,0:34:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.61,0:34:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.08,0:35:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可以住手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.98,0:35:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们至少帮我解决一下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could at least,help me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.06,0:35:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们饶了你一命 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't kill you,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.29,0:35:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,即使杀你易如反掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though it would've been very easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.40,0:35:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.08,0:35:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你们欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且没有人想谢谢我警告你们这是个陷阱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I get no credit for warning you this was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.53,0:35:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Poughkeepsie 想起来了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poughkeepsie,ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.77,0:35:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,又要矫情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.76,0:36:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是无法接受Crowley居然有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just still can't get over with the fact that Crowley has a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.07,0:36:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便问问 他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.91,0:36:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.36,0:36:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该明白吧 他必须回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get this,he's gotta go back,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.65,0:36:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,回到他本来的时间点\N{\fnArial\fs30}To his own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.25,0:36:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他回去了 他就注定会登上那艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lad goes back,his destiny is to board a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.59,0:36:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去美国的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bound for America.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘船在风暴里沉没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ship went down in a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.78,0:36:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,无一人生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hands were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.38,0:36:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在有一个机会 可以改变自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has one chance in this world to change his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.79,0:36:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,难道还要继续上演悲剧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want that all ended in tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.59,0:36:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.19,0:36:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,规矩就是规矩 他必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rule,he goes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.62,0:36:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的传说都指明了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore all says the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.75,0:36:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要对历史作出一点更改\N{\fnArial\fs30}You change any one thing in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所有与之有关联的事都会被影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll rip all the fact and impact everything in the follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.93,0:36:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,论不按规矩出牌 有人比得过你们两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one bends the rules than you two bend the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小破孩掀不起多大的风浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one misfit kid,he impacts no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.69,0:36:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能破坏规矩 明白吗 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't bend the rule,okay?You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.07,0:36:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把他带回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take him back to the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.37,0:37:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法破掉那个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And figure out the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,事情只能这样解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.13,0:37:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,至少让我去说声再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,当我彻底摆脱了人性的折磨 我会欢欣雀跃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cheer the day when the last trace of humanity leaves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.07,0:37:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,情之一字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.87,0:37:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.75,0:37:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘船沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.84,0:37:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的余生真是多姿多彩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's a good fit with the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.61,0:37:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用不着哭鼻子 Gavin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mustn't snivel,Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.05,0:37:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,过去你的命运也许是如此 可是现在不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might fit the old lives,this one could be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.02,0:37:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我对21世纪一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know the first thing about the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.93,0:37:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.22,0:38:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小心便宜威士忌和便宜妓女就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just avoid cheap whisky and cheap hookers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.50,0:38:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都慈父了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting all fatherly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.62,0:38:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你是在说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is goodbye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.48,0:38:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.94,0:38:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.21,0:38:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你小子把自己弄死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless of course I catch you smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我会亲自去揍你一顿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case,I'll smack you stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.43,0:38:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.89,0:38:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.55,0:38:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.65,0:38:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy,easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.38,0:38:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拥抱什么的就不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 Gavin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye,Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别到处提你是地狱王子的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go mentioning that all Prince of Hell thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很多小圈子不是很喜欢这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't play too well in most circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.59,0:38:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我没把Crowley的警告告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell you about the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道 如果我跟你说了实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I knew exactly what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.98,0:38:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定会确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make sure that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我一起走进那件屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right along aside me going into that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.83,0:39:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说像我们经常干的那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like what we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.43,0:39:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们是合作关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're actually partners in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.25,0:39:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们彼此照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we watch each other's backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不指望你能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.58,0:39:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次把初刃拿在手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I touched that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.15,0:39:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.12,0:39:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I wouldn't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我会不顾一切杀死Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I would take down Abaddon and.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.46,0:39:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,挡我者杀之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else if I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.68,0:39:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为逞英雄那档子事儿 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't a hero thing you know it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.42,0:39:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我握着它的时候内心很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.86,0:39:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我必须独自承担这个 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had to go it alone Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.89,0:39:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.45,0:39:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你又觉得我需要你的保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's just another time when you had to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能会被Abaddon抓住要挟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have gotten nabbed by Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她就有机会溜走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could have bargained her way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.80,0:40:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这次可输不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't afford to screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.22,0:40:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.01,0:40:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad it worked out,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.55,0:40:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴那刀能给你力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad the blade gives you strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.98,0:40:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,或者让你冷静下来 或者别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or calm or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Dean 我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dean I gotta to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.94,0:40:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这把刀可能有别的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm started to think the blade is doing something else too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 比如什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah like what.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.08,0:40:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定 比如对你有影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know like something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.06,0:40:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.61,0:40:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们确定能够解决掉Crowley之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we know for sure that we're gonna kill off Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.01,0:40:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不如把刀放远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we store the blade somewhere distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.79,0:40:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,锁在一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked it up somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.40,0:40:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.14,0:40:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No
